Use `ConnectivityState`, not raw `ConnectivityResult`, for app behavior. Configure reachability with `Connectivity().setAddressCheckOption(...)`. Listen through `Connectivity().onConnectivityChanged` and cancel subscriptions in `dispose`. Use `checkVPNConnectivity()` only where platform support is expected.
